        "description": "Deployed preview. Diagnose a portfolio: resolve statement lines, fees, look-through, movement (POST).\n\nthe active ETFs tracking an index the owner-reviewed list maps to each filed class.\n\nThis playground selects `equivalents` on `POST /portfolio`. See the [full resource reference](/api-docs/v2/reference/portfolio) for all variants.",
